UID:10058961-1779908400-1779919200@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:After Ours
DESCRIPTION:After Ours is a two-man wrecking crew with influences ranging from modern jazz to grunge to instrumental hip hop & experimental music. Hybrid 7-string guitarist/loop aficionado Eli Kahn creates sonic layer cakes with the aid of his effects arsenal\, while drummer Joe Enright’s ever-expansive jazz beat backdrops create a sound that is all their own. Since the band’s inception in 2015\, After Ours has built a following with their dynamic live performances all over the Midwest and Southeast. The band’s most recent release\, “Music for Cats”\, is an homage to the cinematic psychedelia & jazz fusion that has shaped their musical path.  www.afterours.band \n$10 at the door (all ticket proceeds are 100% passed to the band\, backed by a living wage guarantee from Hotel Eve) \n*Reserve a table in advance\, or join us impromptu the night of the show. Reservations/advance tickets are recommended for preferred seating\, but not required. Tickets are available at the door on a first-come\, first-served basis.  Event Details and Tickets \nHotel Eve is your locally rooted\, speakeasy jazz club & cocktail bar\, hidden in the heart of Downtown Asheville. Mysteriously not a hotel…check in for spirits\, souls and jazz! We’re tucked away\, on purpose. You’ll find us behind the gate nestled between Virtue Boutique and Dane Wells Gallery at 56 N Lexington Avenue in downtown Asheville. Step through\, take a left into the courtyard\, check in for Spirits\, Souls & Jazz. We’ll be waiting on the other side. hotelevejazz.com \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/after-ours-2/2026-05-27/
LOCATION:Hotel Eve Jazz\, 56 N Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
